href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fb97e4c4-e5ff-4625-9fc4-e336834d65af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fb97e4c4-e5ff-4625-9fc4-e336834d65af\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the lab level of <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I am pleased to report that we have sourced a vessel and pilot to transport the hostages to the Iron Throne. <a href=\"/wiki/Redhammer\" title=\"Redhammer\">Redhammer</a> is a godless fool, but his love of gold outweighs any moral qualms he might have - he will do for now.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Gauntlet_of_Bane\" title=\"Black Gauntlet of Bane\">Black Gauntlet</a> Hahns Rives\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203038\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1602/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27923/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6536/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936658/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.197      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.197      1 -total\n 56.52%   23.283      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.47%   20.791  